000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ACCOUNT-DB2.
000300 AUTHOR. DB2-MODERNIZATION-LANE.
000400
000500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000600 DATA DIVISION.
000700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000800 01 WS-ACCOUNT-ID       PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
000900 01 WS-ACCOUNT-NAME     PIC X(30).
001000 01 WS-BALANCE          PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
001100 01 WS-BALANCE-IND      PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
001200 01 WS-EVENT-TYPE       PIC X(8).
001300 01 WS-LOG-ID           PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
001400
001500      *> DB2 status fields inspected after every EXEC SQL block.
001600 01 SQLCODE              PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
001700 01 SQLSTATE             PIC X(5).
001800
001900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002000 MAIN-PARA.
002100     PERFORM READ-ACCOUNT
002200     PERFORM ADD-ACCOUNT
002300     PERFORM ADJUST-BALANCE
002400     PERFORM DELETE-ACCOUNT
002500     PERFORM SCAN-ACCOUNTS
